[{"start": 0.3, "end": 3.310642201834862, "text": "Take a dark room, kill the lights, and crank the music.", "words": [{"w": "Take", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.542}, {"w": "a", "s": 0.569, "e": 0.666}, {"w": "dark", "s": 0.676, "e": 0.918}, {"w": "room,", "s": 0.945, "e": 1.235}, {"w": "kill", "s": 1.268, "e": 1.51}, {"w": "the", "s": 1.537, "e": 1.73}, {"w": "lights,", "s": 1.752, "e": 2.139}, {"w": "and", "s": 2.182, "e": 2.375}, {"w": "crank", "s": 2.397, "e": 2.687}, {"w": "the", "s": 2.719, "e": 2.913}, {"w": "music.", "s": 2.934, "e": 3.273}]}, {"start": 3.6106422018348616, "end": 4.90091743119266, "text": "You've got a nightclub.", "words": [{"w": "You've", "s": 3.611, "e": 3.949}, {"w": "got", "s": 3.987, "e": 4.181}, {"w": "a", "s": 4.202, "e": 4.299}, {"w": "nightclub.", "s": 4.31, "e": 4.842}]}, {"start": 5.20091743119266, "end": 9.394311926605504, "text": "But by midnight it's packed, and if a fire breaks out, not everyone gets out.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 5.201, "e": 5.394}, {"w": "by", "s": 5.416, "e": 5.561}, {"w": "midnight", "s": 5.577, "e": 6.013}, {"w": "it's", "s": 6.061, "e": 6.303}, {"w": "packed,", "s": 6.33, "e": 6.717}, {"w": "and", "s": 6.76, "e": 6.954}, {"w": "if", "s": 6.975, "e": 7.12}, {"w": "a", "s": 7.136, "e": 7.233}, {"w": "fire", "s": 7.244, "e": 7.486}, {"w": "breaks", "s": 7.513, "e": 7.851}, {"w": "out,", "s": 7.889, "e": 8.131}, {"w": "not", "s": 8.158, "e": 8.351}, {"w": "everyone", "s": 8.373, "e": 8.808}, {"w": "gets", "s": 8.857, "e": 9.099}, {"w": "out.", "s": 9.126, "e": 9.367}]}, {"start": 9.694311926605504, "end": 12.32862385321101, "text": "So you put a bouncer on the door with a clicker.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 9.694, "e": 9.839}, {"w": "you", "s": 9.856, "e": 10.049}, {"w": "put", "s": 10.071, "e": 10.264}, {"w": "a", "s": 10.286, "e": 10.382}, {"w": "bouncer", "s": 10.393, "e": 10.78}, {"w": "on", "s": 10.823, "e": 10.968}, {"w": "the", "s": 10.985, "e": 11.178}, {"w": "door", "s": 11.2, "e": 11.442}, {"w": "with", "s": 11.468, "e": 11.71}, {"w": "a", "s": 11.737, "e": 11.834}, {"w": "clicker.", "s": 11.845, "e": 12.28}]}, {"start": 12.62862385321101, "end": 16.23064220183486, "text": "Once he hits the number the exits can handle, nobody else gets in.", "words": [{"w": "Once", "s": 12.629, "e": 12.871}, {"w": "he", "s": 12.897, "e": 13.043}, {"w": "hits", "s": 13.059, "e": 13.301}, {"w": "the", "s": 13.328, "e": 13.521}, {"w": "number", "s": 13.543, "e": 13.881}, {"w": "the", "s": 13.919, "e": 14.112}, {"w": "exits", "s": 14.134, "e": 14.424}, {"w": "can", "s": 14.457, "e": 14.65}, {"w": "handle,", "s": 14.672, "e": 15.059}, {"w": "nobody", "s": 15.102, "e": 15.44}, {"w": "else", "s": 15.478, "e": 15.72}, {"w": "gets", "s": 15.747, "e": 15.989}, {"w": "in.", "s": 16.016, "e": 16.209}]}, {"start": 16.530642201834862, "end": 19.702568807339443, "text": "But teenagers stroll past him with their big brother's ID.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 16.531, "e": 16.724}, {"w": "teenagers", "s": 16.746, "e": 17.23}, {"w": "stroll", "s": 17.283, "e": 17.622}, {"w": "past", "s": 17.66, "e": 17.902}, {"w": "him", "s": 17.928, "e": 18.122}, {"w": "with", "s": 18.143, "e": 18.385}, {"w": "their", "s": 18.412, "e": 18.703}, {"w": "big", "s": 18.735, "e": 18.928}, {"w": "brother's", "s": 18.95, "e": 19.434}, {"w": "ID.", "s": 19.488, "e": 19.681}]}, {"start": 20.002568807339443, "end": 21.18532110091742, "text": "So you add a scanner.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 20.003, "e": 20.148}, {"w": "you", "s": 20.164, "e": 20.357}, {"w": "add", "s": 20.379, "e": 20.572}, {"w": "a", "s": 20.594, "e": 20.691}, {"w": "scanner.", "s": 20.701, "e": 21.137}]}, {"start": 21.48532110091742, "end": 24.657247706422005, "text": "Under UV and infrared light, a real ID shows hidden marks.", "words": [{"w": "Under", "s": 21.485, "e": 21.776}, {"w": "UV", "s": 21.808, "e": 21.953}, {"w": "and", "s": 21.969, "e": 22.163}, {"w": "infrared", "s": 22.184, "e": 22.62}, {"w": "light,", "s": 22.668, "e": 23.007}, {"w": "a"